sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Agent Console
    participant Ctl as ClientsController /<br/>ClientIsolationController
    participant Iso as ClientIsolationService
    participant Proxy as ClientAgentProxyService
    participant Sched as BullMQ repeatable job
    participant Mgr as Agent Manager<br/>(IsolationCapabilitiesService, AgentsService)
    participant Docker as Docker daemon<br/>(runc, runsc-systrap, runsc-kvm<br/>and their -hostnet variants)
    participant DB as Database<br/>(client_isolation_snapshots)
    participant Pub as AgenstraNotificationPublisher

    Note over Mgr,Docker: Probe on the agent manager: startup, every AGENT_ISOLATION_PROBE_INTERVAL_MS (default 6h, jitter),<br/>POST /api/isolation/probe, and after AGENT_ISOLATION_FAILURE_THRESHOLD runtime failures of a gVisor level (counted per level)

    Mgr->>Docker: docker info (version, kernel, registered runtimes and runtimeArgs)
    Mgr->>Docker: standard probe on runc (worker image: start, runtime check, volume I/O, exec, non-root exec, logs)
    loop Each gVisor level independently: sandboxed (runsc-systrap) and sandboxed-kvm (runsc-kvm)
        alt Level disabled (AGENT_ISOLATION_SANDBOX_ENABLED / AGENT_ISOLATION_SANDBOX_KVM_ENABLED=false)
            Mgr->>Mgr: level = disabled-by-admin
        else Runtime not registered
            Mgr->>Mgr: level = unsupported (E_RUNTIME_NOT_REGISTERED)
        else Probe image unavailable
            Mgr->>Mgr: level = probe-failed (E_PROBE_IMAGE_UNAVAILABLE)
        else Guarded and hostnet runtime not registered
            Mgr->>Mgr: level = unsupported (E_SHARED_NETNS_RUNTIME_NOT_REGISTERED)
        else sandboxed-kvm runtime registered with another platform or network mode
            Mgr->>Mgr: level = probe-failed (E_RUNTIME_MISCONFIGURED)
        else Standard floor not ready
            Mgr->>Mgr: level = probe-failed (E_RUNC_PROBE_FAILED)
        else Standard floor ready
            Mgr->>Docker: level probe on its runtime (same checks, /dev/kvm missing gives E_KVM_UNAVAILABLE)
            Mgr->>Docker: shared netns: runc owner + member on the hostnet runtime (NetworkMode container:owner)
        end
    end
    Mgr->>Mgr: revision = sha256(facts + states), recommendedLevel = strongest ready level

    Note over Ctl,Pub: Controller fetch, snapshot and transitions

    alt Workspace response / GET /api/clients/:id/isolation
        UI->>Ctl: GET /api/clients/:id (or /isolation)
        Ctl->>Iso: summaryForClient / getSummary
        Iso->>Proxy: getClientIsolation(clientId)
        Proxy->>Mgr: GET /api/isolation
        Mgr-->>Proxy: HostIsolationCapabilitiesDto (404 on legacy managers)
    else POST /api/clients/:id/isolation/probe (Re-check)
        UI->>Ctl: POST /api/clients/:id/isolation/probe
        Ctl->>Iso: probe(clientId)
        Iso->>Proxy: probeClientIsolation(clientId)
        Proxy->>Mgr: POST /api/isolation/probe
        Mgr-->>Proxy: HostIsolationCapabilitiesDto
    else isolation-capabilities.coordinator / .unit (ISOLATION_CAPABILITIES_INTERVAL_MS, default 15m)
        Sched->>Iso: findClientIdsDue(ISOLATION_CAPABILITIES_BATCH_SIZE) then refresh(clientId)
        Iso->>Proxy: getClientIsolation(clientId)
        Proxy->>Mgr: GET /api/isolation
        Mgr-->>Proxy: HostIsolationCapabilitiesDto
    end

    alt Capabilities received (completed probe, revision changed)
        Iso->>DB: conditional UPDATE / INSERT snapshot (winner publishes)
        Iso->>Pub: isolation.sandbox_available / _unavailable (sandboxed)
        Iso->>Pub: isolation.sandbox_kvm_available / _unavailable (sandboxed-kvm)
        Iso->>Pub: isolation.baseline_failed (standard)
        Iso-->>Ctl: ClientIsolationSummaryDto (supported, stale=false)
    else Manager unreachable
        Iso->>DB: load last snapshot
        Iso-->>Ctl: ClientIsolationSummaryDto (stale=true)
    else Legacy manager (no isolation endpoint)
        Iso-->>Ctl: supported=false, standard only (E_MANAGER_UNSUPPORTED)
    else Manager without sandboxed-kvm
        Iso-->>Ctl: sandboxed-kvm filled as unsupported (E_MANAGER_UNSUPPORTED)
    end

    Note over UI,Pub: Environment creation

    UI->>Ctl: POST /api/clients/:id/agents { isolationLevel?, capabilityRevision }
    Ctl->>Iso: planCreation(clientId, request, userId)
    Iso->>Proxy: getClientIsolation(clientId)
    Proxy->>Mgr: GET /api/isolation
    alt Invalid level
        Iso-->>UI: 400
    else Standard baseline not ready
        Iso-->>UI: 503
    else Stale revision or level not ready
        Iso-->>UI: 409 (never downgraded)
    else Valid
        Ctl->>Proxy: createClientAgent(isolationLevel, current revision, selectedBy)
        Proxy->>Mgr: POST /api/agents
        Mgr->>Mgr: re-validate against current capabilities (400 / 409 / 503)
        Mgr->>Docker: create egress guard (runc) and worker on runtime of the level (hostnet variant when guarded or on the agent network)
        alt Worker started
            Mgr->>Mgr: persist isolation_level + isolation_selection, recordRuntimeSuccess
            Mgr-->>Ctl: 201 AgentResponseDto (isolation)
            opt Weaker level than recommended
                Ctl->>Pub: agent.isolation_override
            end
            Ctl-->>UI: 201
        else gVisor worker failed (sandboxed or sandboxed-kvm)
            Mgr->>Mgr: recordRuntimeFailure per level (re-probe after threshold), no retry on a weaker level
            Mgr-->>Ctl: 400 E_ISOLATION_RUNTIME_FAILED (isolationLevel)
            Ctl->>Pub: agent.sandbox_creation_failed
            Ctl->>Iso: refresh(clientId)
            Ctl-->>UI: 400
        end
    end
